--- !u!114 &884809422
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 884809409}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Alright, are you ready to put your newfound powers to use?
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 884809410}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Absolutely. Bring it on
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: IdlePunchingBag
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Wait up, soldier.. You haven't even touched your DECK!
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1387872096}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: You didn't hear this from me, but it's not the SIZE of the deck that matters...
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1387872096}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'It''s the POTENCY.

      Heh.

      Heheheh.'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1387872096}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: (STRETCH buries her palm in her face. Ugh. Boys.)
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 884809410}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: Seriously, if I were you, I'd go into the menu by pressing ESCAPE, clicking
      your portrait, and editing your DECK. You can add new moves here and take out
      the ones that aren't up to snuff.
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 884809410}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 1
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
