--- !u!114 &1007453507
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1007453493}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: 'oh, there you guys are.

      we meet again, old friend'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: 'Nova??

      The baddest of them all? In the flesh??!

      For what
      do I owe the honor?'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: 'yep it is I. i am her. the very one. long time no see, or whatever

      well,
      at least for you.

      i, on the other hand, have been spying on you for
      days'
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'You really haven''t changed a bit after joining the ninjas! Welcome back,
      other bestie!

      ...Awfully talkative for someone who''s taken a vow of
      silence'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: 'not so loud, storm.

      they don''t need to know.'
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: anyway i try to stay neutral and observe, but the spartans are becoming
      a pain in my rear
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'we better take down these posters...

      i don''t know what their leader
      Chrome Dome wants with our friend but it can''t be good'
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Oh, you're getting that vibe too? I'm not just going insane?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: arguably you should be less sane. this is no time for sanity.
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: '*ahem* I have it all under control. Naturally.'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'you look hot when you''re on a mission.

      well, who am I to stop
      you. carry on. but look, if you do me a favor and take down 5 WANTED POSTERS
      in this forest, give em to me for a reward'
    name: Nova
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: 'i might be on a mission but like,

      why would i do anything when
      i can get you to do it for me'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 718702535}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
