  - text: 'Wh...

      Who?!

      How?!?'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: 'You don''t have to act so surprised,

      I''ve been following you the
      whole time'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1779771471}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'It was so nice of you, finding those tapes for me.

      The only loose
      ends I had left to tie up...'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1779771471}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Besides Spartan Jack, of course.

      But tying him up wasn''t enough'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1779771471}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: 'You''re...

      Jade?!?'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: 'I see you''ve heard of me...

      This could be a problem

'
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1779771471}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
