  - text: Against every instinct of self-preservation, you open the door of the FIGHT
      CLUB
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: Why is it so obvious anyway? Isn't that breaking at least one rule of fight
      club?
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: 'But, you wouldn''t know, of course.

      You''ve never been to a FIGHT
      CLUB until now.'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
