      propertyPath: disableAfterUse
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[0].text
      value: You see a mysterious purple light... and two voices
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[1].face
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[1].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[1].text
      value: '"This isn''t what I asked for". This one is male, deep. An adult'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[2].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[2].text
      value: '"What do you mean? It''s perfect". A girl''s voice, not much older
        than you'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[3].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[3].text
      value: '"It''s a fake"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[4].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[4].text
      value: The girl sighs and says, "Come closer"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[5].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[5].text
      value: ...You struggle to hear the conversation. Peering through the crack,
        you can only make out two shadows
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[6].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[6].text
      value: You hear... The sound of a fist hitting a skull. The shuffle of clothing.
        An ear piercing scream, suddenly covered by a hand.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[7].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[7].text
      value: And suddenly, silence. Where did the figures go? If only you could find
        a way into the yard
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[8].pose
      value: ArmsCrossed
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[8].text
      value: '(Tip: You can double-jump and grab onto rooftop ledges)'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1771011392191703348, guid: 7d84b769d9d68594d8edc7d2f9820d18, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.Array.data[0].character
